Flask-Migrate/Alembic owns the event schema.

Apply committed revisions:
    flask --app server.wsgi:app db upgrade

Inspect the current revision and detect uncommitted model/schema changes:
    flask --app server.wsgi:app db current
    flask --app server.wsgi:app db check

Revision 0001_gift_exchange validates and adopts the pre-Alembic SQLite schema
without rewriting existing event data. It also initializes fresh databases.
Do not change this revision after publication; add a new revision instead.
The initial baseline intentionally refuses a destructive downgrade below it.

PaaS runs upgrade under its per-app lock before starting/reloading Gunicorn.
Never run migrations from application startup or db.create_all().
